@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title Component Diagram – Peer Review System (HTTP & Nginx Proxy)

package "User Device" {
  component "Vue.js SPA\n(Frontend in Browser)" as FrontendApp
}

package "Kubernetes Cluster (Minikube)" {
  
  component "Ingress Controller" as Ingress
  
  component "Nginx\n(Web Server &\nAPI Reverse Proxy)" as NginxProxy

  package "Backend Microservices" {
    component "Authentication Service" as Auth
    component "Assignment Service" as Assignment
    component "Submission Service" as Submission
    component "Review Service" as Review
    component "Reporting Service" as Reporting
  }

  package "Data Stores" {
    database "PostgreSQL\n(Users)" as DBAuth
    database "MongoDB\n(Assignments)" as DBAssignment
    database "MongoDB\n(Submissions)" as DBSubmission
    database "MongoDB\n(Reviews)" as DBReview
    component "MinIO\n(Object Storage)" as MinIOStorage
  }
}


' === Flusso Utente e API ===
FrontendApp --> Ingress : HTTP (Richieste Web)
Ingress --> NginxProxy : HTTP (Instradamento al Nginx Proxy)

NginxProxy --> FrontendApp : HTTP (File SPA) ' Nginx serve la SPA al frontend
NginxProxy --> Auth : API HTTP (Proxy)
NginxProxy --> Assignment : API HTTP (Proxy)
NginxProxy --> Submission : API HTTP (Proxy)
NginxProxy --> Review : API HTTP (Proxy)
NginxProxy --> Reporting : API HTTP (Proxy)


' === Accesso ai Database ===
Auth --> DBAuth : SQL
Assignment --> DBAssignment : MongoDB Driver
Submission --> DBSubmission : MongoDB Driver
Review --> DBReview : MongoDB Driver


' === Interazioni con Object Storage ===
Submission --> MinIOStorage : S3 API (HTTP)


' === Chiamate API Inter-Servizio (HTTP, interne al cluster) ===
' Queste chiamate avvengono direttamente tra i servizi.
Review -[#blue]-> Assignment : API HTTP (interna)
Review -[#blue]-> Submission : API HTTP (interna)
Submission -[#blue]-> Assignment : API HTTP (interna)
Reporting -[#blue]-> Assignment : API HTTP (interna)
Reporting -[#blue]-> Submission : API HTTP (interna)
Reporting -[#blue]-> Review : API HTTP (interna)


' === Dipendenze per Validazione JWT (Recupero Chiave Pubblica) ===
' Tutti i servizi che necessitano di validare un token potrebbero recuperare la chiave pubblica da Auth.
' Questa è una chiamata API HTTP interna al servizio Auth.
Assignment .[#green].> Auth : API HTTP (interna, /public_key)
Submission .[#green].> Auth : API HTTP (interna, /public_key)
Review .[#green].> Auth : API HTTP (interna, /public_key)
Reporting .[#green].> Auth : API HTTP (interna, /public_key)


note right of Auth
  **Validazione JWT:**
  I servizi backend validano i JWT.
  Possono farlo recuperando la chiave
  pubblica dal servizio di Autenticazione
  tramite una chiamata API HTTP interna
  all'endpoint `/public_key`.
end note

note bottom of NginxProxy
  **Nginx (Web Server & API Reverse Proxy):**
  - Serve i file statici della Vue.js SPA.
  - Inoltra le chiamate API dal Frontend
    ai microservizi backend appropriati.
end note

@enduml